  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EN\u1EBFu \u0111\u00E3 c\u00E0i: ng\u1EAFt m\u1EA1ng tr\u00EAn \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i ho\u1EB7c m\u00E1y t\u00EDnh \u0111\u00F3, t\u1EAFt Wi-Fi v\u00E0 t\u1EAFt d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u di \u0111\u1ED9ng, r\u1ED3i ng\u1EEBng d\u00F9ng m\u00E1y. T\u1EEB \u0111\u00E2y tr\u1EDF \u0111i, m\u1ECDi vi\u1EC7c l\u00E0m tr\u00EAn m\u1ED9t thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB kh\u00E1c m\u00E0 b\u1EA1n tin c\u1EADy.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </actions>
    <approvedBy>
      <Value><![CDATA[Ban biên tập]]></Value>
    </approvedBy>
    <question>
      <Value><![CDATA[Người lạ bảo tôi cài ứng dụng để được hỗ trợ. Có nên cài không?]]></Value>
    </question>
    <reason>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EC\u00E0i c\u00F4ng c\u1EE5 \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n l\u00E0 giao c\u1EA3 \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i cho ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\u00E1c. \u0110\u1ECDc m\u00E3 x\u00E1c th\u1EF1c l\u00E0 giao lu\u00F4n ch\u00ECa kh\u00F3a t\u00E0i kho\u1EA3n. Kh\u00F4ng c\u00F3 c\u01A1 quan hay ng\u00E2n h\u00E0ng n\u00E0o c\u1EA7n nh\u1EEFng th\u1EE9 \u0111\u00F3 c\u1EE7a m\u00ECnh.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </reason>
    <relatedPages>
      <Value><![CDATA[umb://document/37ea5c835a975585a294d78e0c32a5f8]]></Value>
    </relatedPages>
    <shortAnswer>
      <Value><![CDATA[Không cài. Người khác gửi đường dẫn và bảo bạn cài ứng dụng là một dấu hiệu phải dừng.]]></Value>
    </shortAnswer>
  </Properties>
